# Reading the news in Russian: a headline
subtitle: "The first snow, the bridges, a new metro station: read a short Petersburg news item and learn how a Russian headline is built."
tags: ["russian","russian news","russian reading","headlines","petersburg"]
teaches: ["reading/reading-news"]
thumb: "band \"Read the news in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Saying ты at work in Russian: давай на ты","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/124-russian-let-us.cast"}

## Reading the news in Russian: a headline
stress: new
level: basic
shuffle: true
heading: false

    glossed s0 "В Петербу́рге вы́пал пе́рвый снег" say_voice a gloss ["","","fell","",""] show_gloss under gloss_size 26 read_first true stress none x 500 y 600 width 960 font_size 50 hidden true
    glossed s1 "Сего́дня но́чью в го́роде произошло́ большо́е собы́тие: вы́пал пе́рвый снег." say_voice a gloss ["","","","","happened","","event","fell","",""] show_gloss under gloss_size 26 stress none x 500 y 410 width 960 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s2 "Пого́да днём — ми́нус оди́н гра́дус и ве́тер." say_voice a gloss ["weather","","","","","",""] show_gloss under gloss_size 26 stress none x 500 y 220 width 960 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s3 "Жи́тели ра́ды: у́тром го́род стал бе́лым." say_voice a gloss ["residents","","","","",""] show_gloss under gloss_size 26 read_first true stress none x 500 y 600 width 960 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s4 "Одна́ко на доро́гах бы́ло мно́го маши́н, и лю́ди опа́здывали на рабо́ту." say_voice a gloss ["however","","","","","","","","","",""] show_gloss under gloss_size 26 stress none x 500 y 410 width 960 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s5 "Несмотря́ на снег, мосты́ бу́дут разводи́ть ещё две неде́ли." say_voice a gloss ["","","","","","","","",""] show_gloss under gloss_size 26 stress none x 500 y 220 width 960 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s6 "А на Васи́льевском о́строве постро́или совреме́нную ста́нцию метро́." say_voice a gloss ["","","","","built","modern","",""] show_gloss under gloss_size 26 read_first true stress none x 500 y 600 width 960 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s7 "Её вы́ход — пря́мо на на́бережную." say_voice a gloss ["","","","","embankment"] show_gloss under gloss_size 26 stress none x 500 y 410 width 960 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s8 "Ста́нция откро́ется в декабре́." say_voice a gloss ["","","",""] show_gloss under gloss_size 26 stress none x 500 y 220 width 960 font_size 40 hidden true
