A: Шесть вопро́сов. Послу́шайте: the Moscow news.
    icon t_radio size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["loudspeaker"] icon_look picture of radio

    ask "What opened in Moscow?" listen [{"voice":"b","who":"Ра́дио","text":"Но́вости Москвы́. Вчера́ в це́нтре откры́ли но́вый мост.","gloss":"The Moscow news. Yesterday a new bridge opened in the centre."},{"voice":"b","who":"Ра́дио","text":"Жи́тели ра́ды: тепе́рь до рабо́ты — де́сять мину́т.","gloss":"Residents are glad: now it's ten minutes to work."},{"voice":"b","who":"Ра́дио","text":"Одна́ко мост то́лько для люде́й, не для маши́н.","gloss":"However, the bridge is only for people, not for cars."}] options ["a new bridge","a new metro station","a new school"] correct 1 reveal.text "но́вый мост" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 230 reveal.style label reveal.size 56 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        right: Откры́ли но́вый мост: a new bridge.
        wrong: Откры́ли но́вый мост: a new bridge.
    voice b

    erase question_6_stamp

    ask "Who can cross the new bridge?" listen same options ["only people on foot","only cars","cars and people"] correct 1 test t1
        right: То́лько для люде́й: only people.
        wrong: Мост то́лько для люде́й, не для маши́н.
    voice b

    erase t_radio

