A: So a headline puts the verb before the thing that happened, in the perfective past.
    highlight sum1 color #5b8c5a effect underline

B: And where English says is, Russian puts a dash.
    highlight sum2 color #5b8c5a effect underline part —

    erase sum1 sum2 sum_t

