      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:16rm2n5'
    '|a||Да́льше. Ни́на Петро́вна, at my door. Tap Practise after the dialogue.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1fpijnv'
    '|b||Сообще́ние от Ма́ши: И в Москве́ снег!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4000
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:59ikyt'
    '|a||Напиши́те the headline: The first snow has fallen in Moscow.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:4hpvuf'
    '|a||Пра́вильно! The verb before the snow, in the past.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||В Москве́ вы́пал пе́рвый снег.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2840
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Шесть вопро́сов. Послу́шайте: the Moscow news.':
