      ms: 4560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1pypm6d'
    '|b||Но́вости Москвы́. Вчера́ в це́нтре откры́ли но́вый мост.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4280
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1wilqu2'
    '|b||Жи́тели ра́ды: тепе́рь до рабо́ты — де́сять мину́т.':
