      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||So a headline puts the verb before the thing that happened, in the perfective past.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:yzkpzz'
    '|b||And where English says is, Russian puts a dash.':
